{"id":4499,"name":"DR TEAL&#8217;S SHEA SUGAR SCRUB WITH VIT C 538G","slug":"dr-teals-shea-sugar-scrub-with-vit-c","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sliquebeautylimited.com\/product\/dr-teals-shea-sugar-scrub-with-vit-c\/","sku":"810021207254","short_description":"<p>Dr Teal\u2019s Shea Sugar Body Scrub is formulated with Shea Butter, Sugar, and Essential Oils to exfoliate and smooth skin. Citrus essential oil helps uplift your mood, while vitamin C, shea butter, orange oil and coconut oil moisturize the skin.<\/p>","description":"<div id=\"importantInformation_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"importantInformation\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"importantInformation\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"importantInformation_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"2njzae-r3xkcs-w1skzc-b5zpmz\" data-cel-widget=\"importantInformation_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"important-information\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-extra-large bucket\">\n<div class=\"a-section content\">\n<p>Dr Teal\u2019s Shea Sugar Body Scrub is formulated with Shea Butter, Sugar, and Essential Oils to exfoliate and smooth skin. Citrus essential oil helps uplift your mood, while vitamin C, shea butter, orange oil and coconut oil moisturize the skin.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">VITAMIN C REFRESH: Begin your morning with a rejuvenating Vitamin C sugar scrub<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">GENTLE EXFOLIATION: Gently exfoliates skin with pure sugar ingredients. Use Vitamin C in the morning to awaken the senses and start your day and use Sleep Blend at night for a better night&#8217;s sleep<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">MOISTURIZING SHEA BUTTER: Shea Butter and Essential Oils moisturize and leave skin feeling soft and smooth<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">PREPARE FOR SLEEP: With the relaxing Nighttime Shea Sugar Scrub<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">CALM BODY &amp; MIND: Formulated with Essential Oils to help calm the mind and uplift the mood when you need it the most<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"a-section content\">\n<h5>DIRECTIONS<\/h5>\n<p>Massage Dr Teal\u2019s Shea Sugar Body Scrub onto wet skin in circular motions, focusing on rough, dry areas. Rinse thoroughly. Great for use in bath or shower, or as a hand scrub.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"services-widget-1_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"services-widget-1\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"services-widget-1\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"services-widget-1_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"g204zh-kxh1zg-hcbwre-jr7jad\" data-cel-widget=\"services-widget-1_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"services-widget-1_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"services-widget-1_feature_div\">\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"services-widget-2_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"services-widget-2\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"services-widget-2\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"services-widget-2_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"7ym8mv-dcmyp6-9xvs9p-78anz5\" data-cel-widget=\"services-widget-2_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"services-widget-2_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"services-widget-2_feature_div\">\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"click-to-call_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"click-to-call\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"click-to-call\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"click-to-call_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"bs0b3d-4kwfcv-d82r6y-w5pc7\" da